    "body": "<div class=\"bs-callout bs-callout-requirements\">\n<p>This feature is only available to customers in the United States with an existing Facebook or Instagram Shop.</p>\n</div>\n<p>Learn how to sync reviews from Klaviyo to Meta Shops, so shoppers using Facebook and Instagram can see your customer reviews and ratings.</p>\n<p>Why is this important? Ratings and reviews are proven to build trust with potential buyers and may significantly enhance the performance of your Shop. In fact, a recent experiment showed that products with an average rating of 4.25 (out of 5 stars) and over 100 reviews experienced up to a 10% increase in transactions on Facebook and Instagram.</p>\n<h2 id=\"h_01JV767KCYCCG8N7DXFH9EV00M\">Sync reviews to Meta</h2>\n<ol>\n<li>Navigate to the <strong>Reviews</strong> tab.</li>\n<li>Select <strong>Reviews settings</strong>.</li>\n<li>Select <strong>Syndication</strong>.</li>\n<li>Under <em>Meta</em>, toggle on the <em>Facebook and Instagram </em>option to enable Meta syndication.<br>\n\n<img src=\"https://klaviyo.zendesk.com/hc/article_attachments/36974029426075\" alt=\"\" width=\"592\" height=\"163\">\n</li>\n<li>In your reviews syndication settings, Meta syndication will be marked as <em>Pending</em>. The syndication may take several minutes or longer to activate. After that point, reviews will be synced on an ongoing basis.</li>\n</ol>\n<p>It can take up to 24 hours for reviews to appear in Meta Shops.</p>\n<h2 id=\"h_01JV767KCY18AGFN4NBXZW6E5H\">Disable Meta syndication</h2>\n<p>To disable the sync with Meta:</p>\n<ol>\n<li>Navigate to the <strong>Reviews</strong> tab. </li>\n<li>Select <strong>Reviews settings</strong>.</li>\n<li>Select <strong>Syndication</strong>.</li>\n<li>Under <em>Meta</em>, toggle off the <em>Facebook and Instagram </em>option to disable Meta syndication.</li>\n</ol>\n<p>Data will stop syncing from Klaviyo to Meta and old data will be deleted from Meta after 28 days.</p>",
    "user_segment_ids": []
  },
